      "id": "sentence-hard-016",
      "type": "sentence",
      "difficulty": "hard",
      "sourcePack": "extended-hsk1-10",
      "topic": "Sentence practice",
      "zh": "我们上课的时候要听老师说话，下课以后可以给朋友打电话，但是不要在课上看电视。",
      "py": "Wǒmen shàngkè de shíhou yào tīng lǎoshī shuōhuà, xiàkè yǐhòu kěyǐ gěi péngyou dǎ diànhuà, dànshì búyào zài kè shàng kàn diànshì.",
      "en": "During class we need to listen to the teacher. After class we can call friends, but we shouldn't watch TV in class.",
      "breakdown": [
        {
          "zh": "我们",
          "py": "wǒmen",
          "en": "we / us"
        },
        {
          "zh": "上课",
          "py": "shàngkè",
          "en": "attend class"
        },
        {
          "zh": "的",
          "py": "de",
          "en": "possessive / modifier particle"
